/**
 * The knowledge base of the help assistant (Gadi 2026-11-15).
 *
 * Written from the site itself: the step-by-step guides (lib/guide-i18n.ts)
 * and the plan rules in the code. One language (Hebrew); the model answers in
 * the user's language. Every item is a question and its answer, the whole
 * list goes into the prompt (about 70 items, no search).
 *
 * Rules for whoever edits it:
 * - Only what is true in the product today. When a screen changes, change
 *   its item in the same commit.
 * - Nothing internal: no admin pages, no secrets, no partner codes, no
 *   internal accounts.
 * - `money: true` marks prices, plans, buying and trials: such items never
 *   reach the model inside the Google Play or iOS app.
 * - Hebrew to the reader in the plural, no long dashes, Gadit in Latin
 *   letters, plan names in Latin letters.
 */

